      }
    },
    "Past a limit, older items are cleaned up automatically; pinned items are kept. The content size limit counts item content (SUM(size_bytes)), not the database file size. With “Clean up images only”, automatic cleanup deletes only image items and keeps text and rich text; if most space is used by text or pinned images, usage may stay above the limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过上限后会自动清理较旧的条目（置顶条目会被保留）。“内容估算上限”按条目内容体积（SUM(size_bytes)）计算，不等同于数据库文件大小。开启“仅清理图片”后，自动清理只会删除图片条目（文本、富文本等会永久保留）；若主要占用来自文本或已置顶的图片，可能无法降到上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
