            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取存储统计"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layout scale affects only font metrics and line wrapping in Markdown previews and PNG exports; the exported image width stays fixed. Link previews are off by default: when on, bare links in assistant content such as ChatGPT or Codex fetch a title and thumbnail over the network and are frozen locally as cards. Rendering and export always stay offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "渲染比例只影响 Markdown 预览和 PNG 导出的字体度量与换行；导出图片宽度仍保持固定。链接预览增强默认关闭：开启后，ChatGPT/Codex 等助手内容里的裸链接会联网抓取标题与缩略图并冻结为本地数据渲染成卡片；渲染与导出本身始终离线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This shortcut may already be used by the system or another app. Reverted to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该快捷键可能已被系统或其他应用占用，已恢复为 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will permanently delete all clipboard history. This action cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将永久删除全部剪贴板历史，且无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thumbnail height": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩略图高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thumbnails": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩略图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thumbnails and previews": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩略图与预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thumbnails make the list easier to scan. Hover a row to preview the original; the delay avoids accidental previews.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启缩略图可提升列表可读性；悬停可预览原图（延迟用于避免误触）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiered storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分层存储"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "总计"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try clearing filters or adjust search": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "试试清除筛选或调整搜索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撤销"
          }
        }
